# Cloudflare Pages redirects.
# Format: <source>  <destination>  <status>
# https://developers.cloudflare.com/pages/configuration/redirects/
#
# Affiliate-link redirect wrapping. Source paths under /go/* are
# brand-neutral on-domain URLs that 302-redirect to the underlying
# affiliate URL. Reader sees stonemegan.dev/go/<merchant> until they
# click; the merchant's tracking still works because cookies are set
# on the destination after the redirect.
#
# This is used because the underlying affiliate URLs sometimes carry
# the author's real name in the ?via=/?lmref= parameter and the
# privacy policy is to keep real names off reader-visible surfaces.

/go/beehiiv  https://www.beehiiv.com/?via=tong-shen  302

